<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SIO_000260> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "An abstract entity is an entity that exhibits zero, one or more physical manifestations." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SIO_000260> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
